o1618413406 reputon-reviews-text">I purchased the Space 60 hyperbaric oxyge=
n chamber from Morelli Medical and had an amazing experience! I really cann=
ot say enough good things about this transaction. This was not a commercial=
 purchase. I was purchasing the Space 60 for personal health reasons and wa=
s not very familiar with the product or industry. In light of the cost of t=
he Space 60, being unfamiliar with this type of equipment and the process f=
or purchasing one, it was definitely overwhelming. I was also very concerne=
d about putting down a large deposit with a company that I was not familiar=
 with for something that would not be delivered to my residence for several=
 weeks. I did my due diligence and spoke with many providers. I eventually =
decided to go with this company because of Arnold, one of the proprietors. =
Arnold answered all of my calls and responded to literally hundreds of ques=
tions I asked him. He never seemed to be bothered in answering any of them.=
 Arnold even came up with solutions to specific needs that were not typical=
ly offered by the Space 60 that no one else offered.

The choice to go with this company ended up being the right one. I provided=
 my large deposit and everything worked out great. Arnold was amazing to wo=
rk with throughout the entire process and remained committed to giving me t=
he best purchase experience throughout the entire transaction. Arnold conti=
nued to treat me the same way after the order was submitted. He kept me inf=
ormed about the status of the order, shipment, delivery, installation and a=
nswered all of my calls, text messages and emails promptly. Overall, the ex=
perience with Arnold was outstanding, I could not be happier with this purc=
hase experience.

So far, I am extremely happy with the Space 60 that was recently delivered =
and installed at my residence. It looks great and it is easy to operate. I =
do get claustrophobic in MRI machines but I have no such issues with the Sp=
ace 60. I actually enjoy sitting in it and like all of the window space. It=
 is extremely comfortable and I find the whole experience relaxing while ge=
tting treatments in the Space 60. I was really worried about the Space 60 b=
eing uncomfortably warm but it has not been the case. I bought a small batt=
ery operated fan which has helped keep the temperature very comfortable. In=
 fact, I typically have a blanket over me.

A pic of the Space 60 delivered to my house is included with the review. If=
 you are looking to buy a Space 60, I highly recommend you talk with Arnold=
. I found Arnold to be a very trustworthy and sincere person with high inte=
grity, that handled every detail of the transaction in a very professional =
manner.</div></div><div class=3D"go1481296246 reputon-single-review"><div c=
