hasing from two other companies.  After an extensive phone call to Morelli =
Medical with a gentleman named Nuke, I was assured this was a good company.=
  He answered all of my questions and kept me updated through the whole pro=
cess.  We ordered the Oxyrevo Heal 40 1.4 ATA Wheelchair Chamber. When we r=
eceived the hyperbaric chamber, my husband=E2=80=99s wide wheelchair would =
not fit into the opening.  We were devastated after spending our savings on=
 something he could not use.  Nuke assured me that the company would make e=
very effort to rectify the problem.  THEY MADE A SPECIAL RAMP FOR THE WHEEL=
CHAIR.  It is perfect now.  Also, when we first received the chamber, I had=
 an issue and Nuke had David, from Customer Support, to call me immediately=
 and walked me through what I needed to do.  David said to call him anytime=
 for any questions.  Everyone that I communicated with from the company was=
 overly eager to make us happy.

We have lots of medical appointments and therapies several times a week.  I=
